 ==============================================================================
 ENTERPRISE MINIO & TRAEFIK STACK CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
 Instructions: Copy this file, rename it to '.env', and fill in your secrets.
 ==============================================================================

 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 MinIO Core Secrets
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Root administrative user (min. 3 characters)
MINIO_ROOT_USER=admin

 Strong, unique root password (min. 8 characters)
MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=CHANGEME_USE_A_STRONG_PASSWORD

 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Local Network / Domain Settings (Optional documentation)
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 If you customize hostnames in docker-compose, document them here:
 MinIO S3 API Endpoint:     http://s3.localhost
 MinIO Web Administration:  http://console.localhost
 Traefik Dashboard:         http://localhost:8888
